{
  "title": "Namaz on Wednesdays",
  "code": "0",
  "data": "Imam al-Hasan al-’Askari(a.s.) is also reported to have said that whoever offers on Wednesdays a four unit prayer; reciting in each unit Surah al-Faatehah, Surah al-Tawheed, and Surah al-Qadr, Almighty Allah will accept his repentance from all sins and will give him in marriage a Paradisiacal woman."
}
